title: Reaching Out
new-page: true
view-if: erc_reach_out_timer <= 0
on-arrival: {! 
    Q.month_actions += 1; 
    Q.erc_reach_out_timer = 9; 
    Q.party_reaching_out_map = 1;

    Q.congreso_party_tour_viewed_rest = false;
    Q.congreso_party_tour_viewed_catalonia = false;
    Q.congreso_party_tour_viewed_eh = true;
    Q.congreso_party_tour_viewed_ppcc = true;
    Q.congreso_party_tour_viewed_galicia = true;
    Q.congreso_party_tour_viewed_others = false;
    Q.congreso_party_tour_highlight = ["galicia", "ppcc", "eh", "catalonia"];
!}
on-departure: {!
    Q.party_reaching_out_map = 0;
!}
max-visits: 36
is-card: true
card-image: img/erc/ararepubliques.jpg
# face-image: img/erc/ararepubliques.jpg
frequency: 100
tags: erc_party
role: card-party

= Reaching Out

Across the Spanish state, many share in our struggle. Be others also fighting for independence or, more broadly, for decentralization and republicanism, we're hardly alone. It's always a good idea to reach out and help each other.

{!<div id="congreso-party-tour-widget" style="width: 95%; margin: 0 auto;"></div>!}

- @bng_reach
- @pnv_reach
- @ehbildu_reach
- @gbai_reach
- @amaiur_reach
- @compromis_reach
- @mes_reach
- @return: We don't need to reach out to any of them at the moment
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

